=== FIXED/REQUIRES ATTENTION: deduped_010_lccn ===
=== A record had more than one 010 (LCCN) field, or a single 010 with more
===   than one $a -- merged into exactly one 010. Every $a on the record is
===   compared with its whitespace stripped: if they all normalize the same,
===   the stripped value is kept and nothing is lost; if two or more normalize
===   to genuinely different values, the numerically largest one is kept and
